So,

\[ v_s = 8 \text{ km/h} \]
\[ v_{\text{relative}} = 7 \text{ km/h} + 8 \text{ km/h} = 15 \text{ km/h} \]

Now calculate the time:

\[ t = \frac{ e221}{15} = \frac{221}{15} \approx 13.9667 \text{ hours} \]

Therefore, under these assumptions, the two trains will meet approximately after **13.27** hours.

